/surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Richards</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennington</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Debs</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Desprez</surname><given-names>PY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Id-1 as a molecular target in therapy for breast cancer cell invasion and metastasis</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2003</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>13543</fpage><lpage>13548</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Proc Natl Acad Sci USA||100|13543||bib9|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jemal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Tiwari</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghafoor</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Samuels</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Feuer</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Thun</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><collab>American Cancer Society</collab></person-group><article-title>Cancer statistics</article-title><source>CA Cancer J Clin</source><year>2004</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>8</fpage><lpage>29</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'CA Cancer J Clin||54|8||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14974761</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kohler</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Janz</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Wintzer</surname><given-names>HO</give